 * @param {Entrypoint} entrypoint a chunk group
 * @param {(Chunk | null)=} excludedChunk1 current chunk which is excluded
 * @param {(Chunk | null)=} excludedChunk2 runtime chunk which is excluded
 * @returns {Set<Chunk>} chunks
