 * Processes the provided hash.
 * @param {Hash} hash the hash to update
 * @param {ChunkGraph} chunkGraph chunkGraph
 * @param {EntryModuleWithChunkGroup[]} entries entries
 * @param {Chunk} chunk chunk
 * @returns {void}
